"fmp_official_ev":4444.4,"enterpriseValueBasis":"USD market capitalization + USD debt - USD cash and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":1801.5,"ev_to_ebitda":18,"debt_to_ebitda":3.34,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-6.47,"f_score":5,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":0,"detail":"當期 ROA = -25.6%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $224M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 35.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 18.29"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":3.27,"default_fair_val":3.27,"premium_pct":81.3,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":3.4,"pb_forward":3.1,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":5.04,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":35,"cash_to_assets":81.8,"current_ratio":18.29,"roe":-39.4,"roa":-25.6,"moat":{"ticker":"JOBY","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 作為空中計程車（eVTOL）的先驅，其品牌知名度與潛在的市場領導地位構成了初步的定價權壁壘。然而，目前該產業尚處於萌芽階段，消費者對此類服務的接受度、價格敏感度以及品牌忠誠度尚未經過市場長期考驗。相較於成熟的航空業或交通運輸業，Joby 的品牌價值仍有待建立與鞏固。其定價策略將高度依賴於營運效率、載客量以及監管環境的成熟度。目前來看，品牌雖有潛力，但尚未形成強大的、可持續的定價權。","comment_en":"Joby Aviation, as a pioneer in the air taxi (eVTOL) sector, possesses brand recognition and potential market leadership that form an initial barrier to pricing power. However, the industry is still nascent, and consumer acceptance, price sensitivity, and brand loyalty for such services have yet to be tested by the market over the long term. Compared to mature aviation or transportation industries, Joby's brand value still needs to be established and solidified. Its pricing strategy will heavily depend on operational efficiency, passenger volume, and the maturity of the regulatory environment. Currently, while the brand has potential, it has not yet formed a strong, sustainable pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 在 eVTOL 技術領域擁有廣泛的專利組合，涵蓋了其獨特的傾斜旋翼設計、電池技術和飛行控制系統。這些專利構成了重要的技術壁壘，使其競爭對手難以複製其核心技術。此外，公司積極與美國聯邦航空總署（FAA）等監管機構合作，推動 eVTOL 的適航認證流程。成功的適航認證將是其商業化的關鍵，並可能形成一種准入壁壘，因為獲得認證的過程複雜且成本高昂。然而，監管環境仍在演變中，未來可能出現新的標準或挑戰。","comment_en":"Joby Aviation holds an extensive patent portfolio in the eVTOL technology domain, covering its unique tilt-rotor design, battery technology, and flight control systems. These patents constitute significant technological barriers, making it difficult for competitors to replicate its core technologies. Furthermore, the company is actively collaborating with regulatory bodies like the U.S. Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) to advance the airworthiness certification process for eVTOLs. Successful airworthiness certification will be crucial for its commercialization and may form an entry barrier, as the certification process is complex and costly. However, the regulatory landscape is still evolving, and new standards or challenges may emerge in the future."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"對於空中計程車服務而言，轉換成本相對較低。乘客在選擇服務時，主要考量點是便利性、價格和可靠性，而非深度綁定的技術或系統。一旦出現更具吸引力的替代方案，例如更便宜、更快捷或更方便的服務，乘客轉換的門檻不高。Joby Aviation 的挑戰在於建立卓越的服務體驗和可靠性，以培養客戶的忠誠度，而非依賴高昂的轉換成本。與企業級軟體或基礎設施相比，其客戶黏性有待加強。","comment_en":"For air taxi services, switching costs are relatively low. When passengers choose a service, their primary considerations are convenience, price, and reliability, rather than deeply integrated technology or systems. If a more attractive alternative emerges, such as a cheaper, faster, or more convenient service, the threshold for passengers to switch is not high. Joby Aviation's challenge lies in establishing an excellent service experience and reliability to foster customer loyalty, rather than relying on high switching costs. Compared to enterprise software or infrastructure, its customer stickiness needs strengthening."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 的網絡效應潛力主要體現在其飛行網絡的擴張。隨著起降點（vertiports）的增加和飛行路線的增多，服務的便利性和覆蓋範圍將隨之提升，吸引更多乘客，進而產生正向循環。同時，更多的飛行數據有助於優化飛行路線和調度，提高營運效率。然而，這種網絡效應的建立需要大量的基礎設施投資和時間，並且受到地理區域和監管的限制。與傳統社交網絡或市場平台相比，其網絡效應的強度和廣度仍有發展空間。","comment_en":"Joby Aviation's potential for network effects is primarily reflected in the expansion of its flight network. As the number of vertiports increases and flight routes multiply, the convenience and coverage of the service will improve, attracting more passengers and thus creating a virtuous cycle. Simultaneously, more flight data will help optimize flight paths and scheduling, enhancing operational efficiency. However, establishing this network effect requires substantial infrastructure investment and time, and is constrained by geographical areas and regulations. Compared to traditional social networks or marketplace platforms, the strength and breadth of its network effects still have room for development."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 透過規模化生產和營運，有望實現顯著的成本優勢。隨著產量增加，其 eVTOL 飛機的製造成本將逐步下降。同時，飛行網絡的擴大和載客量的提升，將攤薄固定營運成本（如飛行員、維護、起降場地費用），降低每趟飛行的單位成本。此外，其專注於電動垂直起降技術，長期來看可能比傳統燃油航空器具有更低的能源和維護成本。然而，目前產業尚處於早期，規模經濟的效益尚未完全顯現，且初期投入巨大。","comment_en":"Through scaled production and operations, Joby Aviation is expected to achieve significant cost advantages. As production volume increases, the manufacturing cost of its eVTOL aircraft will gradually decrease. Concurrently, the expansion of the flight network and increased passenger volume will spread fixed operating costs (such as pilot, maintenance, and vertiport fees), lowering the unit cost per flight. Furthermore, its focus on electric vertical takeoff and landing technology may lead to lower energy and maintenance costs compared to traditional fossil-fuel aircraft in the long run. However, the industry is still in its early stages, the benefits of economies of scale have not yet fully materialized, and initial investments are substantial."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 的獨特地理資產體現在其選擇的關鍵市場和潛在的起降點佈局。公司選擇在監管相對寬鬆、市場需求潛力大的地區（如美國加州）進行早期試點和認證。其與物流公司（如DHL）和軍方建立的合作關係，也為其進入特定市場和應用場景提供了獨特的機會。然而，這些地理優勢並非絕對的、不可複製的。隨著行業發展，其他競爭者也可能進入相同或相似的市場，並爭奪關鍵的起降點資源。","comment_en":"Joby Aviation's unique geographical assets are reflected in the key markets it selects and its potential vertiport layout. The company has chosen regions with relatively lenient regulations and high market demand potential (such as California, USA) for early trials and certification. Its partnerships with logistics companies (like DHL) and the military also provide unique opportunities to enter specific markets and application scenarios. However, these geographical advantages are not absolute or irreplicable. As the industry develops, other competitors may also enter the same or similar markets and compete for crucial vertiport resources."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 在營運效率方面展現出潛力，特別是透過其創新的電動垂直起降（eVTOL）設計和優化的飛行管理系統。電動動力系統預期能帶來比傳統燃油飛機更低的維護成本和更高的可靠性。自動化和數據分析的應用，有助於提高飛行調度效率和載客率。然而，作為一個新興產業，Joby 仍需克服大規模商業運營中的挑戰，包括確保飛行員的穩定供應、起降基礎設施的建設以及應對潛在的技術故障。其營運效率的持續提升將是關鍵。","comment_en":"Joby Aviation shows potential in operational efficiency, particularly through its innovative electric vertical takeoff and landing (eVTOL) design and optimized flight management system. The electric powertrain is expected to offer lower maintenance costs and higher reliability than traditional combustion-engine aircraft. The application of automation and data analytics can help improve flight scheduling efficiency and load factors. However, as a nascent industry, Joby still needs to overcome challenges in large-scale commercial operations, including ensuring a stable supply of pilots, developing vertiport infrastructure, and addressing potential technical failures. Continuous improvement in its operational efficiency will be key."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 的資本配置策略顯得相當積極且專注。公司將大量資源投入於研發、專利保護、適航認證以及關鍵人才的招募，這些都是建立長期競爭優勢的必要投資。其現金儲備充足（約 22 億美元現金對約 7.5 億美元負債），為其研發和擴張計畫提供了堅實的財務支持。管理層似乎專注於實現技術領先和商業化目標，避免了過度多元化。然而，高額的研發投入和漫長的商業化週期也意味著較長的投資回報期，需要謹慎的資金管理。","comment_en":"Joby Aviation's capital allocation strategy appears quite aggressive and focused. The company invests substantial resources in R&D, patent protection, airworthiness certification, and recruiting key talent, all of which are necessary investments for building long-term competitive advantages. Its ample cash reserves (approx. $2.2 billion in cash against approx. $750 million in debt) provide solid financial backing for its R&D and expansion plans. Management seems focused on achieving technological leadership and commercialization goals, avoiding excessive diversification. However, the high R&D expenditure and long commercialization cycle also imply a longer period for investment returns, requiring prudent financial management."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 的客戶保留策略將高度依賴於其服務的可靠性、便利性和整體體驗。由於空中計程車服務的性質，乘客轉換成本不高，因此建立客戶忠誠度是關鍵。公司可透過會員計畫、個性化服務以及與企業客戶建立長期合作關係來提升客戶保留率。成功的商業化運營和良好的安全記錄將是贏得客戶信任和重複使用的基礎。然而，在產業初期，客戶的長期忠誠度尚未經過充分驗證，仍需持續努力。","comment_en":"Joby Aviation's customer retention strategy will heavily depend on the reliability, convenience, and overall experience of its service. Given the nature of air taxi services, switching costs for passengers are not high, making customer loyalty crucial. The company can enhance customer retention rates through loyalty programs, personalized services, and establishing long-term partnerships with corporate clients. Successful commercial operations and a strong safety record will be the foundation for earning customer trust and repeat usage. However, in the early stages of the industry, long-term customer loyalty has not been fully validated and requires continuous effort."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Joby Aviation 的長期可持續性取決於其能否在快速變化的航空科技領域保持技術領先，並成功實現商業化。其專利技術、電動動力系統的潛在成本優勢以及與監管機構的良好關係，為其提供了較強的長期競爭力。然而，該行業面臨著技術快速迭代、潛在的新進入者以及不斷演變的監管環境等多重挑戰。Joby 需要持續創新並有效應對這些外部因素，才能確保其護城河的持久性。其商業模式的長期可行性仍有待市場的進一步驗證。","comment_en":"Joby Aviation's long-term sustainability depends on its ability to maintain technological leadership in the rapidly evolving field of aerospace technology and successfully achieve commercialization. Its patented technology, potential cost advantages of electric powertrains, and good relationships with regulatory bodies provide it with strong long-term competitiveness. However, the industry faces multiple challenges, including rapid technological iteration, potential new entrants, and an evolving regulatory environment. Joby needs to continuously innovate and effectively respond to these external factors to ensure the durability of its moat. The long-term viability of its business model still requires further market validation."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Joby Aviation 作為空中計程車（eVTOL）的先驅，展現出在技術專利（M2）和資本配置（M8）方面的顯著優勢，這些構成了其核心競爭力。其創新的電動技術和積極的監管合作，為其建立了一定的進入壁壘。然而，品牌定價權（M1）、客戶轉換成本（M3）和網絡效應（M4）相對較弱，顯示其商業模式尚處於發展初期，客戶忠誠度和市場滲透率有待提升。規模經濟（M5）和營運效率（M7）具有潛力，但需時間實現。整體而言，Joby 擁有一個具備潛力的「技術型」護城河，類似於早期的高科技公司，其長期價值取決於技術的持續領先、監管的順利推進以及商業模式的成功驗證。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"As a pioneer in the air taxi (eVTOL) sector, Joby Aviation demonstrates significant advantages in technological patents (M2) and capital allocation (M8), which form its core competitiveness. Its innovative electric technology and proactive regulatory engagement have established certain entry barriers. However, its brand pricing power (M1), customer switching costs (M3), and network effects (M4) are relatively weaker, indicating that its business model is still in its early stages, with customer loyalty and market penetration yet to be enhanced. Economies of scale (M5) and operational efficiency (M7) show potential but require time to materialize. Overall, Joby possesses a 'technology-driven' moat with considerable potential, akin to an early-stage high-tech company. Its long-term value hinges on sustained technological leadership, smooth regulatory progress, and successful validation of its business model.","evidenceHash":"db6fb4166ae86d7133b4d569a4f7a67be04acead367ac72a50b67dfd09a60fa1","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"db6fb4166ae86d7133b4d569a4f7a67be04acead367ac72a50b67dfd09a60fa1","currentEvidenceHash":"db6fb4166ae86d7133b4d569a4f7a67be04acead367ac72a50b67dfd09a60fa1"},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T01:39:54.054Z","evidenceHash":"51fdbf478e9d008faf12626776e58d0625493e2619bafe005ed52526f6d1a53a"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T01:39:54.054Z","evidenceHash":"51fdbf478e9d008faf12626776e58d0625493e2619bafe005ed52526f6d1a53a"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/JOBY.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/JOBY.png","website":"https://www.jobyaviation.com","ceo":"JoeBen Bevirt","full_time_employees":"2559","description":"Joby Aviation, Inc. is a vertically integrated air mobility firm specializing in the development of electric vertical takeoff and landing (eVTOL) aircraft. These innovative vehicles are designed to provide on-demand air transportation, with the ultimate aim of launching an aerial ridesharing service. The company was founded in 2009 and operates from its headquarters in Santa Cruz, California.","description_en":"Joby Aviation, Inc. is a vertically integrated air mobility firm specializing in the development of electric vertical takeoff and landing (eVTOL) aircraft. These innovative vehicles are designed to provide on-demand air transportation, with the ultimate aim of launching an aerial ridesharing service. The company was founded in 2009 and operates from its headquarters in Santa Cruz, California.","description_zh":"Joby Aviation, Inc.（美股代碼：JOBY）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Airlines, Airports & Air Services 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"333 Encinal St","city":"Santa Cruz","state":"CA","zip":"95060","country":"US","phone":"831 426 3733","full_address":"333 Encinal St, Santa Cruz, CA 95060, US","range_52w":"4.43-17.1","year_high":17.1,"year_low":4.43,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":4.43,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-11-03","name":"Sciarra Paul Cahill","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":62500,"price":4.97,"total_val":0.31},{"date":"2026-10-14","name":"DeHoff Kate","title":"officer: See Remarks","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":16065,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-14","name":"DeHoff Kate","title":"officer: See Remarks","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":8279,"price":5.09,"total_val":0.04},{"date":"2026-10-14","name":"DeHoff Kate","title":"officer: See Remarks","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":16065,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-14","name":"Allison Eric","title":"officer: Chief Product Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":53549,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-14","name":"Allison Eric","title":"officer: Chief Product Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":27593,"price":5.09,"total_val":0.14},{"date":"2026-10-14","name":"Allison Eric","title":"officer: Chief P